# Keep this folder in git. The real replay clip (demo_clip.mov) lives here locally but is
# gitignored (*.mov), so it is NOT committed. On GitHub Pages the clip will be absent and
# the app falls back to a placeholder stage driven by CONFIG.videoDurationSeconds.
#
# To ship a playable clip to Pages, drop a small compressed demo_clip.mp4 here and point
# CONFIG.videoSrc at it (mp4 plays reliably in browsers; .mov often does not).
